id: tail-held
name: Tail Held
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: the entry names Prone, and this is only what keeps it on.
combatCondition: no
# The Combat Condition this mark keeps from being removed while it is held. Read by
# `setCondition`, which names no mark.
holds: prone
source: Saiyan Heritage
description: >
  A Saiyan's Tail grabbed in a Grapple. You cannot get up from Prone until you escape it.
text: >
  Tail Held: Saiyan Heritage's 4th effect. "If you suffer from Tail Restraint during a Grapple while you are Tailed (see
  the Option effect below), you are immediately knocked Prone and cannot remove the Prone Combat Condition until you
  escape the Grapple."

---

# Gained with the Prone when the Grapple Maneuver's Tail Restraint lands on a Saiyan with a Tail, and taken off when the
# Grapple ends, however it ends (chat.mjs settleGrapple, endGrapple) - the Prone then free to come off as any.
#
# No effects of its own.
